{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02532",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.95,
      "end_seconds": 4.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Lovely to meet you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.03,
      "end_seconds": 9.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.08,
      "end_seconds": 12.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "It's sneezing in spring, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.19,
      "end_seconds": 16.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Okay, how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.71,
      "end_seconds": 22.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Since last night, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.97,
      "end_seconds": 34.16,
      "duration_seconds": 11.19,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.71,
      "end_seconds": 53.21,
      "duration_seconds": 17.5,
      "text": "I get some relief from antihistamine. I'd say mild. Honestly, all the time. I've also had a runny itchy nose, for two weeks. With runny itchy nose, it's a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.03,
      "end_seconds": 60.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.01,
      "end_seconds": 73.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.97,
      "end_seconds": 105.79,
      "duration_seconds": 16.82,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 16, pressure 114 over 69, pulse is 67 beats a minute, SpO2 98 percent on room air. Let me check a few things. Any loss of smell, fever, wheeze or facial pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.46,
      "end_seconds": 110.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.99,
      "end_seconds": 115.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.22,
      "end_seconds": 119.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.1,
      "end_seconds": 125.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.74,
      "end_seconds": 128.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.58,
      "end_seconds": 132.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.46,
      "end_seconds": 137.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Ah, my uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.39,
      "end_seconds": 151.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.96,
      "end_seconds": 155.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "I've had migraines, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.25,
      "end_seconds": 157.95,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Ah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.79,
      "end_seconds": 168.25,
      "duration_seconds": 8.46,
      "text": "Okay, so I've got high blood pressure. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.08,
      "end_seconds": 176.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "Alright, migraines, that matches what I have here. Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.65,
      "end_seconds": 181.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.48,
      "end_seconds": 183.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "What's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.51,
      "end_seconds": 191.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.61,
      "end_seconds": 194.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.39,
      "end_seconds": 198.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.27,
      "end_seconds": 201.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.05,
      "end_seconds": 206.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.87,
      "end_seconds": 209.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "How long have you taken that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.96,
      "end_seconds": 220.77,
      "duration_seconds": 9.81,
      "text": "For six months. I'm on telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day. Loratadine. I take it once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.05,
      "end_seconds": 224.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.76,
      "end_seconds": 226.73,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "10 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.52,
      "end_seconds": 232.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.07,
      "end_seconds": 237.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Yes, erythromycin. I get bad stomach cramps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.15,
      "end_seconds": 248.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.9,
      "end_seconds": 256.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Yes, I had an operation for a hernia, last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.76,
      "end_seconds": 269.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.54,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. The most likely explanation is seasonal allergic rhinitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.69,
      "end_seconds": 274.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.45,
      "end_seconds": 280.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like seasonal allergic rhinitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.46,
      "end_seconds": 299.08,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "You'll be taking fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, once a day, the season. That's for hay fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.34,
      "end_seconds": 303.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Okay, uh, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.72,
      "end_seconds": 307.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.03,
      "end_seconds": 312.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.26,
      "end_seconds": 314.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}